      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1M requests/day = 11.57 requests/s average; 10M/day = 115.74/s, before burst multiplier. Neither means 1M concurrent users.\nAt 1,000 memos/min and mean 25 s residence: ~417 in flight. Tokens/min divided by tokens/memo is throughput, not concurrency.",
      "originalText": "1M requests/day = 11.57 requests/s average; 10M/day = 115.74/s, before burst multiplier. Neither means 1M concurrent users.\nAt 1,000 memos/min and mean 25 s residence: ~417 in flight. Tokens/min divided by tokens/memo is throughput, not concurrency.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0U",
      "autoResize": true,
